{"seq":1,"slug":"forest-mensuration-and-inventory","title":"大学林学 — 森林测计与资源调查","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/forest-mensuration-and-inventory","wordCount":1998,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学林学-森林测计与资源调查\">大学林学 — 森林测计与资源调查</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>经营森林的第一步，是搞清楚&quot;家底有多少&quot;。一片森林里有多少木材？每年新长出多少？哪些到了可以采伐的年龄？没有这些数据，一切经营决策都是盲人摸象。<strong>森林测计</strong>（forest mensuration）就是测量和估算森林数量特征的学问，它是林业的&quot;会计学&quot;——把森林这笔巨大的&quot;绿色资产&quot;用数字记录下来。</p>\n<p>森林测计要解决三个层层递进的问题：怎么测量一棵树的材积？怎么由若干样木推算整片林子的蓄积量？怎么估算森林每年的生长量？而<strong>森林资源调查</strong>（forest inventory）则是把测计方法应用到实际，通过抽样调查摸清一个区域乃至全国的森林资源状况。理解从&quot;一棵树&quot;到&quot;一片林&quot;再到&quot;一个国家&quot;的尺度跨越，以及背后&quot;抽样推断&quot;的统计思想，是本节的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"测量一棵树-胸径-树高与材积\">测量一棵树：胸径、树高与材积</h3><p>测量单株立木从两个最基本的参数开始：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>胸径（DBH）</strong>：树干在离地 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span> 米处的直径，是林业中最重要、最易测的指标。之所以选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span> 米，是因为这个高度便于人站立测量，且避开了树干基部的膨大。用围尺量周长再换算，或用卡尺直接量。</li>\n<li><strong>树高（H）</strong>：从地面到树梢的高度。高树无法直接量，要用测高器，根据三角原理由水平距离和仰角算出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有了胸径和树高，就能估算单株的<strong>材积</strong>（木材体积）。最简单的近似把树干看作圆柱体，再乘一个<strong>形数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>（修正树干上细下粗、并非完美圆柱的系数）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = g \\cdot H \\cdot f = \\frac{\\pi D^2}{4} \\cdot H \\cdot f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = \\frac{\\pi D^2}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是胸高断面积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是胸径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是树高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是形数（通常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4-0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 之间）。实际工作中更常用编制好的<strong>立木材积表</strong>——只要查出胸径和树高，就能直接读出材积，无需每次计算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从样木到林分-标准地调查\">从样木到林分：标准地调查</h3><p>要估算一整片森林（<strong>林分</strong>）的木材总量（<strong>蓄积量</strong>，单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^3/hm^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），不可能把每棵树都测一遍。林业用的是抽样思想：在林分中设置有代表性的<strong>标准地</strong>（样地），测量样地内全部树木，再按面积比例放大到整个林分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[单株: 测胸径树高] --&gt; B[样地: 测全部样木求蓄积]&#10;    B --&gt; C[林分: 按面积放大]&#10;    C --&gt; D[区域/全国: 系统抽样推断]\">graph LR\n    A[单株: 测胸径树高] --&gt; B[样地: 测全部样木求蓄积]\n    B --&gt; C[林分: 按面积放大]\n    C --&gt; D[区域/全国: 系统抽样推断]</pre><p>样地内常用<strong>每木检尺</strong>——逐株测量并按径阶（如每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> cm 一档）归类统计，得到林分的直径分布。结合材积表，就能算出样地蓄积，进而推算整个林分。这一步的关键是样地要有<strong>代表性</strong>且<strong>足够多</strong>，否则抽样误差会很大。这正是统计学&quot;用样本估计总体&quot;思想在林业中的经典应用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"森林的-利息-生长量与收获调整\">森林的&quot;利息&quot;：生长量与收获调整</h3><p>森林是会&quot;自己增值&quot;的资产。<strong>生长量</strong>（increment）指森林在一定时期内材积的增加，它就像存款的&quot;利息&quot;。核心的经营原则是：<strong>采伐量不能长期超过生长量</strong>，否则就是&quot;吃老本&quot;，森林资源会越采越少直至枯竭——这就是著名的<strong>永续利用</strong>思想。一个可持续的森林，理想状态是&quot;采伐量 ≈ 生长量&quot;,每年只取走当年新长出的部分，本金（蓄积）保持稳定。</p>\n<p>衡量森林利用是否合理，有一个直观判据：若年采伐量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 长期小于或等于年生长量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，森林蓄积稳定或增长，是可持续的；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C &gt; I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，则是过伐，蓄积下降。许多国家森林资源的兴衰，都可以用这条简单关系来诊断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"森林资源调查-摸清国家的-绿色家底\">森林资源调查：摸清国家的&quot;绿色家底&quot;</h3><p>把测计方法推广到大区域，就是森林资源调查。中国的森林资源调查分三个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>周期/用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一类调查</td>\n<td>国家森林资源连续清查</td>\n<td>每五年一次，全国系统抽样，摸清国家森林资源总量与动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二类调查</td>\n<td>森林资源规划设计调查</td>\n<td>以经营单位（林场/县）为对象，为编制经营方案服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三类调查</td>\n<td>作业设计调查</td>\n<td>针对具体作业地块，为采伐、造林等设计提供数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>国家森林资源连续清查（&quot;一类清查&quot;）通过在全国布设数十万个固定样地、每五年重复调查，得出全国森林面积、蓄积、覆盖率等关键数据。例如中国第九次清查公布森林覆盖率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23%</span></span></span></span></span>、森林蓄积量超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>170</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">170</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">170</span></span></span></span></span> 亿立方米——这些权威数字，正是无数样地测计数据自下而上汇总的结果。它们是国家林业政策、碳汇核算和&quot;双碳&quot;目标的数据基石。</p>\n<h3 id=\"现代测计技术\">现代测计技术</h3><p>传统每木检尺靠人工尺测，效率低。现代森林测计正在被新技术革新：**激光雷达（LiDAR）**可以从空中或地面扫描出森林的三维点云，自动提取每棵树的高度、冠幅甚至材积；<strong>遥感+地面样地</strong>结合，能高效估算大范围蓄积；无人机航测让样地调查事半功倍。这些技术让&quot;给森林算账&quot;变得越来越快、越来越准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为什么林业选择在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span> 米处测量树木直径（胸径），而不是树的底部或中部？这个高度有什么实用考虑？</li>\n<li>材积公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = g \\cdot H \\cdot f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 中的&quot;形数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;是用来修正什么的？如果把树干当成完美圆柱（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）来算，结果会偏大还是偏小？</li>\n<li>为什么估算一片森林的蓄积量要用&quot;标准地抽样&quot;而不是数每一棵树？抽样的代表性为什么至关重要？</li>\n<li>用&quot;采伐量 vs 生长量&quot;解释&quot;永续利用&quot;思想。一个国家如果连续多年采伐量大于生长量，森林会怎样？</li>\n<li>中国的一类、二类、三类调查分别服务于什么尺度的决策？为什么需要不同层次的调查？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>中国国家森林资源连续清查：可查阅历次清查公报，了解中国森林覆盖率、蓄积量的真实增长曲线</li>\n<li>激光雷达（LiDAR）林业应用：搜索点云提取单木参数的案例，感受现代测计技术的飞跃</li>\n<li>永续利用思想史：源自 18 世纪德国林业（&quot;Nachhaltigkeit&quot;，可持续性一词的最早出处之一就来自林业）</li>\n<li>《测树学》《森林经理学》——系统学习材积测定、蓄积估算与资源调查的中文经典教材</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>森林测计是林业的&quot;会计学&quot;，用数字记录森林这笔绿色资产。测量从单株的胸径（1.3 m 处直径）和树高入手，用材积公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=g \\cdot H \\cdot f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 或材积表估算单株材积。整片林分的蓄积量靠标准地抽样、每木检尺后按面积放大求得，体现&quot;用样本估计总体&quot;的统计思想。生长量是森林的&quot;利息&quot;，永续利用的核心原则是采伐量不超过生长量。森林资源调查分一类（全国连续清查）、二类（经营单位）、三类（作业设计）三个层次，国家连续清查的权威数据是林业政策与碳汇核算的基石。激光雷达等现代技术正让森林测计更快更准。摸清了家底，下一步就是如何科学地采伐并让森林更新再生。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学林学 — 森林测计与资源调查","id":"大学林学-森林测计与资源调查"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"测量一棵树：胸径、树高与材积","id":"测量一棵树-胸径-树高与材积"},{"level":3,"text":"从样木到林分：标准地调查","id":"从样木到林分-标准地调查"},{"level":3,"text":"森林的\"利息\"：生长量与收获调整","id":"森林的-利息-生长量与收获调整"},{"level":3,"text":"森林资源调查：摸清国家的\"绿色家底\"","id":"森林资源调查-摸清国家的-绿色家底"},{"level":3,"text":"现代测计技术","id":"现代测计技术"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学林学 — 森林健康监测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-protection/forest-health-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"大学林学 — 采伐与森林更新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/harvesting-and-forest-regeneration"}}